          "Record the requester and the promised response time. Separate the request from the decision, because a complete request is not an approval. Note the observation window; a case without a period cannot be compared later. A case that moves between owners should keep both owner periods visible. Apply the same {topic} test to access test and to the value that survives in the scheduling platform.",
          "The record should show the source, the decision, and the surviving value in one place. Confirm that the request belongs in this queue before assigning an owner. The next reviewer should not have to ask which document is authoritative. Record the queue and the entity so the case cannot drift into another team's work. A {topic} exception keeps client notice attached and routes the question to the engagement manager."
