          "The next reviewer should not have to ask which document is authoritative. Report age and dependency, not only the total count. A case that moves between owners should keep both owner periods visible. Separate what was observed from what the team believes caused it. In the {topic} queue, an item without a next action is treated as an exception.",
          "If the team cannot reproduce the result from the record, the control is not finished. Separate what was observed from what the team believes caused it. Use case-level review to explain an outlier before calling it a trend. Name the owner for every open item, including items waiting on someone else. The {topic} case note should show what the scheduling platform held at the time and who reviewed it."
