          "Label the version of every file that can change. The record should show the source, the decision, and the surviving value in one place. Archive the extract with the study so it can be repeated. Do not store credentials or unnecessary personal data in the case. The {topic} close note cites the scheduling platform, the approver, and the time of the final check.",
          "Write the note so a reviewer can reconstruct the decision without a meeting. Keep the original request so a later correction does not erase the reason for the work. Name the owner and the date beside each decision. Keep the source reference and the coded value in the same row. Apply the same {topic} test to access test and to the value that survives in the scheduling platform."
